{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "找上门来",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 120.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看另一条路，找上门。",
   "spoken": "再看另一条路，找上门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "这部分涉及人身伤害，我们只讲公开报道的事实，不讲受害人的个人细节。",
   "spoken": "这部分涉及人身伤害，我们只讲公开报道的事实，不讲受害人的个人细节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.82,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 3.82,
   "speechEnd": 9.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "研究者 Jameson Lopp，在 GitHub 上维护一份公开清单。",
   "spoken": "研究者 Jameson Lopp，在 GitHub 上维护一份公开清单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 10.36,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 10.453,
   "speechEnd": 14.727
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "专门记录针对持币人的实体攻击。",
   "spoken": "专门记录针对持币人的实体攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 15.14,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 15.14,
   "speechEnd": 18.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "按这份清单，2023 年 74 起，2024 年 106 起，2025 年 170 起。",
   "spoken": "按这份清单，2023 年 74 起，2024 年 106 起，2025 年 170 起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 18.56,
   "dur": 9.52,
   "speechStart": 18.658,
   "speechEnd": 27.854
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "2026 年截至 10 月底，已有 147 起，其中法国 52 起。",
   "spoken": "2026 年截至 10 月底，已有 147 起，其中法国 52 起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 28.3,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 28.3,
   "speechEnd": 33.808
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "各机构的统计口径不同，数字不能直接比较。",
   "spoken": "各机构的统计口径不同，数字不能直接比较。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 34.2,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 34.2,
   "speechEnd": 37.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "Lopp 本人认为，真实数量被低估了。",
   "spoken": "Lopp 本人认为，真实数量被低估了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 38.18,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 38.279,
   "speechEnd": 40.787
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "2025 年 1 月，Ledger 的一位联合创始人，和伴侣在家中被劫持。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 1 月，Ledger 的一位联合创始人，和伴侣在家中被劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 41.2,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 41.306,
   "speechEnd": 46.631
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "绑匪向 Ledger 方面索要加密货币赎金，法国宪兵特种部队救出了两人。",
   "spoken": "绑匪向 Ledger 方面索要加密货币赎金，法国宪兵特种部队救出了两人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 47.02,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 47.118,
   "speechEnd": 52.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "涉嫌主谋 6 月在摩洛哥落网，2026 年 5 月被当地法院判处 25 年。",
   "spoken": "涉嫌主谋 6 月在摩洛哥落网，2026 年 5 月被当地法院判处 25 年。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 52.76,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 52.76,
   "speechEnd": 59.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "同年 5 月初，一名加密企业家的父亲，在巴黎街头被绑走。",
   "spoken": "同年 5 月初，一名加密企业家的父亲，在巴黎街头被绑走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 60.1,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 60.1,
   "speechEnd": 64.915
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "警方突袭解救，没有支付赎金。",
   "spoken": "警方突袭解救，没有支付赎金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 65.36,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 65.36,
   "speechEnd": 68.138
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "5 月 13 日，交易所 Paymium 的 CEO，女儿和外孙在巴黎街头，遭遇绑架未遂。",
   "spoken": "5 月 13 日，交易所 Paymium 的 CEO，女儿和外孙在巴黎街头，遭遇绑架未遂。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 68.54,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 68.638,
   "speechEnd": 75.713
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "检方之后起诉了 25 人，认为和 5 月初的绑架有关联。",
   "spoken": "检方之后起诉了 25 人，认为和 5 月初的绑架有关联。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 76.12,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 76.12,
   "speechEnd": 80.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "法国内政部长会见业界，宣布了安全简报、紧急呼叫优先响应、住宅安防检查等措施。",
   "spoken": "法国内政部长会见业界，宣布了安全简报、紧急呼叫优先响应、住宅安防检查等措施。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 80.9,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 80.9,
   "speechEnd": 88.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "这几起案件里，目标不只是持币人本人，还有家属。",
   "spoken": "这几起案件里，目标不只是持币人本人，还有家属。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 89.28,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 89.377,
   "speechEnd": 93.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "公开报道还显示，部分团伙把执行环节，外包给临时招募的人。",
   "spoken": "公开报道还显示，部分团伙把执行环节，外包给临时招募的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 93.82,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 93.913,
   "speechEnd": 98.892
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "同在 2025 年 5 月，纽约检方指控两名加密投资者，把一名男子诱到曼哈顿的一处住宅。",
   "spoken": "同在 2025 年 5 月，纽约检方指控两名加密投资者，把一名男子诱到曼哈顿的一处住宅。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 99.32,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 99.32,
   "speechEnd": 107.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "囚禁 17 天，逼他交出比特币密码。",
   "spoken": "囚禁 17 天，逼他交出比特币密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 107.46,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 107.46,
   "speechEnd": 110.718
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "两名被告不认罪，公开报道里，还没有查到判决。",
   "spoken": "两名被告不认罪，公开报道里，还没有查到判决。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 111.12,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 111.217,
   "speechEnd": 114.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "施暴者，也可能是熟人，或者同一个圈子里的人。",
   "spoken": "施暴者，也可能是熟人，或者同一个圈子里的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 115.26,
   "dur": 4.48,
